                                "sense_id": "dde8b7cf-5737-38bb-8c33-6d4282573f7a",
                                "text": "Gentle, affectionate, full of those small courtesies so endearing in daily life, generally silent, but such an appreciating listener, so unworldly, so young, and so lovely—Emily attached those with whom she lived, more than themselves suspected."
